WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.530 line:8% align:center
This one is called the Suzie Q.

2
00:00:04.530 --> 00:00:07.930 line:8% align:center
Cross in front, open, and cross again.

3
00:00:07.930 --> 00:00:11.930 line:8% align:center
Keep the knees soft and rotate from the
torso, not from the arms.

4
00:00:11.930 --> 00:00:15.130 line:8% align:center
A common mistake is lifting the heel too
early.

5
00:00:15.130 --> 00:00:17.980 line:8% align:center
Keep the heel down until the weight
arrives.

6
00:00:18.930 --> 00:00:20.180 line:8% align:center
Slowly now.

7
00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:22.780 line:8% align:center
Cross, open, cross, open.

8
00:00:22.780 --> 00:00:25.400 line:8% align:center
Keep the pressure into the floor.
